			"Message": "chore(Project): Sync Element submodule with Common CHANGELOG revision\n\nSynchronize the Element submodule to 215fc0b1, bringing in Common's documentation update (fd25cb49) that revises the CHANGELOG to use narrative formatting. The revision adds an introductory paragraph explaining Common's role as the abstract core with trait definitions and DTOs, rewrites version headers from [Common/vX.X] to [vX.X] for consistency, and converts bullet-point changes to flowing prose descriptions.\n\nThis follows the prose-style CHANGELOG format migration established across other Land components, ensuring consistent documentation style in the monorepo.",
